{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/020d14a610e815ab4fcea55616f5dcf7.webp?t=1746456800\" width=597 height=38 /></span><br><br>After dying, poisoned for unknown reasons, Isobel finds herself in the afterlife... and on a dangerous mission. Experience a truly unique visual novel full of character, mystery and heart as you point and click your way to unveiling the strange world of Purgatory's many secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/e091bc321dee2c2548fb5b06e8dbe099.webp?t=1746456800\" width=597 height=38 /></span> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/0f83252c4114647bf2567dcec61dfb8f.webp?t=1746456800\" width=10 height=13 /></span> <strong>Enter</strong> a truly memorable story told in four acts, full of choices and branching outcomes both big and small.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/0f83252c4114647bf2567dcec61dfb8f.webp?t=1746456800\" width=10 height=13 /></span> <strong>Explore</strong> the interactive world of Purgatory through a day-night cycle with four segments per day... lots of stuff to click on (or not, if you don't want to).<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/0f83252c4114647bf2567dcec61dfb8f.webp?t=1746456800\" width=10 height=13 /></span> <strong>Meet</strong> unforgettable characters, all with their own fleshed out personalities and agendas, brought to life by partial voice acting.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/0f83252c4114647bf2567dcec61dfb8f.webp?t=1746456800\" width=10 height=13 /></span> <strong>Stay</strong> connected to the Dwellers and Denizens of the afterlife via the PurgaPhone! Send and receive messages, with many of them unique to the choices you make.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/0f83252c4114647bf2567dcec61dfb8f.webp?t=1746456800\" width=10 height=13 /></span> <strong>Partake</strong> in nine different character routes, as well as a number of exciting side stories that further develop the world, and watch as their outcomes change the main narrative in meaningful ways.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/0f83252c4114647bf2567dcec61dfb8f.webp?t=1746456800\" width=10 height=13 /></span> <strong>Marvel</strong> at sprites, backgrounds, special scenes and inventory items all drawn in a beautiful and unique style.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/0f83252c4114647bf2567dcec61dfb8f.webp?t=1746456800\" width=10 height=13 /></span> <strong>Unlock</strong> a wealth of hidden treasures, such as gallery images, music tracks and encyclopedia entries.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/0f83252c4114647bf2567dcec61dfb8f.webp?t=1746456800\" width=10 height=13 /></span> <strong>Bop</strong> your head to a dynamic soundtrack composed by popular YouTube artist Endigo.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2704840/extras/2998a71f43d99a413b7426ceecdfe2cd.webp?t=1746456800\" width=597 height=38 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"ht